{
  "name": "[Unit 3] Flow A — Full Dual-Input Indexing Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Unit 3: Flow A — 雙輸入索引管線（完整版）\n\n### 架構說明\n本工作流實作**雙輸入源的知識庫索引管線**，將 Google Drive 文件與 Notion 頁面統一處理後存入向量資料庫。\n\n### 兩條輸入路徑\n- **路徑 1（Drive）**：Google Drive Trigger → 下載檔案 → 擷取文字 → 正規化欄位\n- **路徑 2（Notion）**：Notion Trigger → 取得頁面內容 → 正規化欄位\n\n### 合併點（Merge）\n兩條路徑在 **Merge** 節點匯合，輸出統一格式：`doc_id`、`title`、`source`、`content`。\n\n### 共享處理管線\n1. **LLM 節點** — 使用 OpenAI 產生摘要（summary）、標籤（tags）與分段（chunks）\n2. **Embeddings 節點** — 將 chunks 向量化\n3. **Pinecone Upsert** — 將向量與 metadata 存入 Pinecone\n4. **Write Index Record** — 回寫 Notion Index Log DB，標記 status=INDEXED\n\n### 使用前準備\n- 替換所有 `YOUR_*` 佔位符為實際 ID\n- 設定四組憑證：Google Drive OAuth2、Notion API、OpenAI API、Pinecone API",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "folderId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID",
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "drive-trigger-1",
      "name": "Google Drive Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "google_drive_oauth2",
          "name": "google_drive_oauth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "drive-download-1",
      "name": "Download File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        350,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "google_drive_oauth2",
          "name": "google_drive_oauth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "text",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "extract-text-1",
      "name": "Extract Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "drive-doc-id",
              "name": "doc_id",
              "value": "=drive_{{ $('Download File').item.json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "drive-title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $('Download File').item.json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "drive-source",
              "name": "source",
              "value": "google_drive",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "drive-content",
              "name": "content",
              "value": "={{ $json.data }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-drive-1",
      "name": "Set Drive Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        850,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "pageAddedToDatabase",
        "databaseId": "YOUR_NOTION_KB_DATABASE_ID",
